    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5902" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμφικτυον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to the Amphictyons</i> or <i>their League,</i>
