				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.143
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ χρήματα τὰ Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.545.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ. ἔγκλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).526.4
				</span></i>
			 (Ceos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
